  "comments": "Mentioned by dPal mang dKon mchog rgyal mtshan in the following passage: \"rngog gi bstan bcos gze ma ra mgo zhes pa las | lam \u2019bras rdo rje tshig rkang la dgag pa yod par grags pa la |\" (see [Q47PVAE6]: 242, n. 53,  <<Kano 2016 [BAQ9MH4T]>>: 207, n. 75). Kramer and Kano take \"rNgog\" to be rNgog Blo ldan shes rab (ID: 3786), which is doubtful. The content is about lam 'bras teaching, for which another branch of the rNgog family led by Chos sku rdo rje (ID: 6115) is famous.",
